{78}{As a youth I was pressed into service by a group of travelers.  They were a rowdy, barbarous lot seeking to gain great wealth and reputation while adventuring throughout the land.  I found my place among them, for at times stealth was called for and this was my greatest ability.}{As a youth I was pressed into service by a group of travelers.  They were a rowdy, barbarous lot seeking to gain great wealth and reputation while adventuring throughout the land.  I found my place among them, for at times stealth was called for and this was my greatest ability.}{}{}{}{lf4 1}
