{83}{ As time progressed, I proved to them that I was no mere impressed servant, and become a valued member of the group.  We adventured together for several years, following old tales and discovering lost treasures.  It was a rich and wild time in my life...  [he gets lost in his thoughts for a moment]}{ As time progressed, I proved to them that I was no mere impressed servant, and become a valued member of the group.  We adventured together for several years, following old tales and discovering lost treasures.  It was a rich and wild time in my life...  [he gets lost in his thoughts for a moment]}{}{}{}{}
