{88}{One fateful day, we were lazing about, recovering from our last adventure.  We had just cleared out a cavern full of lizard men that had been terrorizing the local community.  Deep in the back of the cave, we discovered an unmarked chest, sealed tight.  When we collected our fee from the local magistrate, we conveniently failed to mention the chest.}{One fateful day, we were lazing about, recovering from our last adventure.  We had just cleared out a cavern full of lizard men that had been terrorizing the local community.  Deep in the back of the cave, we discovered an unmarked chest, sealed tight.  When we collected our fee from the local magistrate, we conveniently failed to mention the chest.}{}{}{}{}
{89}{Uh huh...}{}{5}{}{95}{}
{90}{Heh heh, not exactly on the up and up, eh?}{}{5}{}{172}{re -5}
