{95}{It took Nightfire, a half-breed elven member of the troupe, nearly two days to spring the lock and open the chest.  Since Nightfire was an expert with a lock, there was much anticipation and speculation done over the supposed contents of the box. }{It took Nightfire, a half-breed elven member of the troupe, nearly two days to spring the lock and open the chest.  Since Nightfire was an expert with a lock, there was much anticipation and speculation done over the supposed contents of the box. }{}{}{}{}
