{99}{E:}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{100}{Inside the chest, we were disappointed to find only a few coins, several interesting baubles and a book.  As I was the only literate member, I was given the book to review.  Here, I still have the book, why don't you read it for yourself.  Tell me when you have finished, and I will continue.}{Inside the chest, we were disappointed to find only a few coins, several interesting baubles and a book.  As I was the only literate member, I was given the book to review.  Here, I still have the book, why don't you read it for yourself.  Tell me when you have finished, and I will continue.}{}{}{}{in -5232, lf3 1}
