{105}{Ahem...  Yes...  Where was I?  Oh yes, I had just finished reading the book...  We quickly reviewed the map drawn inside to determine our distance from the ruby.  It was several days travel from our encampment.  Fools that we were, we pulled out at daybreak in search of the gem.}{Ahem...  Yes...  Where was I?  Oh yes, I had just finished reading the book...  We quickly reviewed the map drawn inside to determine our distance from the ruby.  It was several days travel from our encampment.  Fools that we were, we pulled out at daybreak in search of the gem.}{}{}{}{lf5 1}
{106}{Yes...}{}{5}{}{110}{}
