{110}{As we neared the locale, it was as the letter described.  The hairs on our necks raised and the forest sounds ceased.  You could feel the apprehension in the air...  Then we came upon the clearing... and the ruby.  It was amazing.  Never have I beheld a more beautiful thing.  We were all mesmerized, dreaming of the pleasure we could enjoy once in possession of such treasure.}{As we neared the locale, it was as the letter described.  The hairs on our necks raised and the forest sounds ceased.  You could feel the apprehension in the air...  Then we came upon the clearing... and the ruby.  It was amazing.  Never have I beheld a more beautiful thing.  We were all mesmerized, dreaming of the pleasure we could enjoy once in possession of such treasure.}{}{}{}{}
{111}{Uh huh...}{}{5}{}{115}{}
