{135}{I fled from the scene of carnage.  I wandered aimlessly for a time, before making Stillwater my home.  I have never left again.  I fear my adventuring days have come to an end.  Yet, as the author of the letter says, the jewel and the beasts still haunt my sleep. }{I fled from the scene of carnage.  I wandered aimlessly for a time, before making Stillwater my home.  I have never left again.  I fear my adventuring days have come to an end.  Yet, as the author of the letter says, the jewel and the beasts still haunt my sleep. }{}{}{}{}
